      "name": "test_top_level_sections_preserved",
      "line_number": 27,
      "docstring": "API envelope invariant:\nAll top-level sections that existed previously must still exist in v10.7.\n\nExample from your baselines:\n  previous: {\"strategy\": {...}, \"qa\": {...}}\n  v10.7:    {\"strategy\": {...}, \"qa\": {...}}",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [
        "_load_baseline",
        "sorted",
        "set"
      ],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "node_type": "function",
      "name": "test_strategy_schema_evolution_superset",
      "line_number": 51,
      "docstring": "Strategy schema evolution:\n\nprevious:\n  \"strategy\": {\n    \"fields\": [\"steps\", \"goal\"],\n    \"version\": \"legacy\"\n  }\n\nv10.7:\n  \"strategy\": {\n    \"fields\": [\"steps\", \"goal\", \"context\"],\n    \"version\": \"v10.7\",\n    ...\n  }\n\nInvariants:\n  - All previous fields are still present.\n  - New fields may be added (e.g., \"context\").\n  - Version must change (no accidental reuse of \"legacy\").",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [
        "set",
        "sorted",
        "_load_baseline"
      ],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "node_type": "function",
      "name": "test_qa_schema_evolution_superset",
      "line_number": 97,
      "docstring": "QA schema evolution:\n\nprevious:\n  \"qa\": {\n    \"fields\": [\"confidence\", \"summary\"],\n    \"version\": \"legacy\"\n  }\n\nv10.7:\n  \"qa\": {\n    \"fields\": [\"confidence\", \"summary\", \"issues\"],\n    \"version\": \"v10.7\",\n    ...\n  }\n\nInvariants:\n  - All previous fields are still present.\n  - New 'issues' field is required in v10.7.\n  - Version must change.",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [
        "set",
        "sorted",
        "_load_baseline"
      ],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "node_type": "function",
      "name": "test_no_contract_regression_on_fields",
      "line_number": 143,
      "docstring": "Global contract check:\n\nFor every top-level section that has a 'fields' array in the previous\nbaseline, ensure that:\n\n  - v10.7 still has that section\n  - v10.7 still has all of those fields (superset)",
